              ],
              "text": "Beginner video editors: getting clients isn't one skill. It's a sequence.\n\nOffer → price → proof → prospects → outreach → follow-up → conversation → proposal → onboarding → delivery.\n\nIt's easy to jump straight to cold DMs and skip the offer and the follow-up. CLIENT MACHINE gives each step a worksheet, script, checklist or tracker, plus a 30-day plan that sets out what to do each day.\n\nIt won't contact anyone for you, and it can't promise results. It gives you a process you can repeat.\n\n$47 USD, one-time."
